{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1217,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79b3f7890bac43dd787e73d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想跟我一决胜负吗？\r\n好啊，来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9388ffb5bdff0449ef612e49a3486c2596325985534dab925b56bf1daa12f333",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10ae9c10f5d40ec3e4523b97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好嘞！\r\n差不多该动真格的了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b139e550e848761350795345fdacbe5f7eb21e83c5efdec3cfdf6ee89bba719",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e5c391a4fe5891b2cdd443c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噢，早啊！\r\n今天我也要踩着油门\r\n跑一整天哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c6d2ddc9ff294b7254f9a6c69edc55d2c9c43028527829c65b537715014f3eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d102ecea906595ac4fe0da89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，训练员！我一早就很幸运嘛♪\r\n喂，告诉我作业的答案……不，提示！\r\n能不能告诉我提示啊！？拜托啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1aede118b0a1ddf0e8a2e42ac21e65742d71c1da639914eb2adf675769997a66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37637c0d10224ad497b758f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊──好困～\r\n可能是昨天太拼了。\r\n去顶楼睡个午觉好了～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dfec3d9683e289d6eb65b90ca3d4248caf8fdc715ad6d6e0951efb31dfabef7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a779c492d3a0ca04a55c938",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呃、被发现了。……没、没有啦，\r\n我才没有打算逃课去跑步呢！\r\n啊哈哈～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d85fcfc6752cb54e24e2b1ac312f72090aa358e0d5c62aabe1748e54a3b5a82b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a85e033b0c2c9ae458cb2e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要熬夜到几点呢～\r\n嘿嘿，你怎么啰嗦都没用哦？\r\n我可不是个乖宝宝！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5413508dccf4a941d51ecaa57b4239ffc639937fff66477638361055c366c034",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac72a9003345402cfb68f42e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噢──还在工作啊。\r\n累不累啊？我用胳膊肘帮你揉揉肩膀吧。\r\n这可是老爸亲传的手法哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3be92675c991af8d0a50841c560d58e02b0012fd4dc050dcf5707b6a1d238dc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a43f746da2f43d7ecad20e3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "油菜花这东西～吃起来虽然\r\n苦苦的不好吃……但从摩托车后座\r\n看到的花田可漂亮了～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64da9f2174d3b4ede2a8158c4e4cf414461ddbc139ea7ade4fe9e6daedf2eba4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3efae3df901f8937f73fb481",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天的阳光不是很强吗？\r\n你觉得带着墨镜跑步怎么样？\r\n又帅又不怕刺眼！是个好提议吧～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bf6f50e4a68ab737de86e7ce7e0ee417dcd70bf4dda5d20b6ee9021931e8073",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3743b7af026c726341c11ee3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "山路上的枫叶，应该都红了吧。\r\n喂，下次我们去跑山路吧！\r\n我知道一个绝佳景点哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "399fd16a2d267dfba25cff4d6bb007c908fd2665ec27091e69528e851082f876",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cd6bc6cb9f8928916ef27d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不要因为帅气就把手\r\n插在口袋里走路哦？\r\n很危险的……虽然我是爱这么做啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe9686901c4fc6f7c2d071c78fed9b2a05cb6714a21d87df08cbbe410155848b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c446eafd39076d264b793814",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有没有乖乖早睡啊～？\r\n只有像我一样的圣诞老人\r\n才有资格熬夜喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93b25e636c019a655a9ad5fcbe852d5c0474adb4bb08cec13d837ddd352dd0c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c89cb70b0a685da8485df83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "趁着夜晚送完所有礼物后\r\n欣赏日出的阳光……啊～！\r\n圣诞老人的工作真是帅气！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c87a0768adb77fbfa63de46433c550006eabeb6f33731b121facb55d1f5e8d7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a49918dcfb9dbc5629784b44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是中午没吃饱，我这里\r\n有些饼干喔。是口感松软、\r\n带有肉桂味的大人口味！",
      "source_fingerprint": "850c0018baea20d45f7690d6624ada1edb89338c5d24f6aed0e59ded36396a5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd2eb096929ab5d831d0857b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊！要是在白天骑摩托车送礼物，\r\n还可以顺便兜风，这下不就\r\n一举两得了吗！？很可行吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f18ce47963ee0fba3d73550260be1c2fbb602893a4bc05e48bcf2b37a1ff1e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c83951485b97df9e8245fa4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "写成神圣的夜晚读做holy night……\r\n总觉得这种的很赞耶！\r\n还有没有更多这种用法啊……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "13c7aa5880f9f275d7b09b83c5aabeb9f4b6a4dfd5efebaf89a78dfc3870b600",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfd02fbf15c7eeb58083b240",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚点去看看你的办公桌吧！\r\n我把我很推的强碳酸饮料\r\n送给努力工作的你啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e450b15636042998fefea3f7b188a57e7e9ed0bfd2964d685f7c581ea62f55f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dad1e08703ed74d00c64077",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天到了啊～圣诞老人得放下工作\r\n暂时休息……你刚才是不是这样想？\r\n喂喂喂，人气王可是没有休假的喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03ac3acc8a60aea1f28c6651c22ba2262f4b076d16ffa5f38cf4114ba9da792c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4690da7758957067284d13b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要、鼓起干劲，\r\n就不会、流汗了啦……\r\n满身大汗的圣诞老人太逊了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1aa5590088d7301ad63ab0461827becf0a02edde1c84e815beac4492568eed63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffdd9dbcc76a83b7c4d9c2fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞老人总是给人一种圆圆胖胖的\r\n印象对吧……啊、别误会！\r\n我可不是因为吃太多在想借口喔！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7153267e07b67ea92d5576f875f270200e29f674d52bac4b0623d981e0ac79a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76493ff483b890238baeec2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员？你看起来好像很冷。\r\n我的耳罩其中一边借你吧？\r\n虽然不知道戴不戴得上去就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "198826eae6d5075d53d321429d566e44b8937540f1a735d5069dbe53d4542f36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f2e0b0269cc122f0e53efef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15593ecde6893906b543420f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36187bca4ded9ef9dd2da116",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……又输给好歌剧前辈了。\r\n为什么她总是能想出\r\n那么帅气的姿势啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cc2f96a33235126b00aabc83693b2a737ade20a9292fa7a825b6671ac616a7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24907f422b03ce72ecad9626",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊──好想要有人可以像老爸那样，\r\n跟我一起热烈讨论\r\n排气管的重低音啊～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8a8cbc1322d503f11a4064f8cca75bd4ce71cb90ac2023206406fc575ab2b70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:959ea3fddb71b7c6d41d5e2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轰隆隆隆隆隆……！\r\n……唉──！\r\n好想快点有自己的爱车啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5527f6728bc1d6422b277d3a8a7c3c1a21269b894743fc05da6fe1cdc012df8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f7b59ff53626accd3de41a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……一想起刚才听到的事，\r\n我脸就发烫……可恶，摩耶那家伙\r\n竟然讲那么激烈的恋爱故事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f2e30ef9bc81f00157bcc7ea230b41eb26a95d736dc5df38504ba735f8bde59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6563cf770efb8d5100cff081",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "白仁前辈。真的好帅啊～！\r\n有威严又强……但我迟早会超越她，\r\n让她追着我的背影的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8783571b0ca013791e3fbdd3b2da6c5886909b777ca550b44acf55e84cf31818",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f4f01ef686f4860a395b4f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……唔唔……哈啊──！\r\n这些蓬蓬的东西让我静不下来啊！\r\n脸好烫！这种东西不适合我啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "143105a231b423d701bbd21766a01fe204262ff04dce83b125d88657b70e91fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:245342ab2632269033f663fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不、不要一直看啦！还、还有！\r\n你绝对不准说出口哦！\r\n可、可爱这种话！绝对不准说哦！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d00391e5e614adad8faec40ec80bae4a5bce32da94dd721c55916215ae09485",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19f37ccfab239f7c51d637cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又轻又方便活动，\r\n真的是很赞的夹克啊！\r\n哇～！好想赶快穿这样跑步啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c082145cbfd9f856b38850d1479b88a817d202f0317d56c5db3ae0f45d80b9e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11abe42f44987db2d82705ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……该摆什么姿势好。\r\n直挺挺地站着，手撑下巴……\r\n不对，把手表秀在前面……嗯──。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac3d93d7285e773afa1e0820c59320c5d3010878a9a240226898191fb1682c6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c5ff0b357590f82ea7b4fe5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哈哈，我想到早上赤骥\r\n头发乱翘的样子了。果然还是要\r\n像我这种随性的发型才最帅！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69a0d0b0d45816c5ce5f3d3198c54d681772187bca2fc9aff91419c11caca5cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de63768d0ebc6c45d1b12da5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀～饭后想要醒脑，\r\n果然就要靠黑咖啡啊～！\r\n用苦味来提神真是……好苦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fed53788a6cdc8d0018ce3d610b3c37a2d267cf6ef0b7ecbbeebb1b4f37df00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17988f4311ab50f09750ed14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天我一定要比谁都早起！\r\n然后去做自主训练！……赤骥\r\n那家伙不知道会是什么表情～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2613f23e6ccc000b19ee7abf157f87d7aedfba9e08bbc3c26ce14c7e2e66fcf5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d79b88c22b095489f1bc5962",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新的一年要充满干劲地过哦！\r\n我会创下大纪录让你看的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "568642c7f90098769efa569b5caa46cefe2cbb28612ccb4bc9c43d90714451b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b8c2ae73647d4ccb7b21da8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "炎热的夏天，\r\n就是要喝麦茶啊ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0dc0baa02fc5534ec7ed0028761d7cea5451b878c576f203ad89a7da9abf5d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da2db89a3cf17ecea6dfd92d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赏月的时候……\r\n总觉得有种血液在骚动的感觉啊～！\r\n这就是孤独一匹狼的宿命吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ff4b6f9c241d0bea1f2db823960f00de5cae57aa870938b300cb23b32ce0cdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e9e7f861bb86e3ea0d358f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好冷！都不想离开被窝了……\r\n以前老妈都会直接把棉被给扯走。\r\n好冷好冷。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95662590dc5209a158428c150cef507901b2dc8d68be2f2d9282f9bacd2793c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e0b2b10d559ee24f8510da8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那家伙不开口的话还满适合的说……\r\n啊、不准告诉赤骥喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "015d7a8d449aadbd2d060c5c5509a5f30fd9a49755947964ec97271cb1e9b08b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:648dccebe3b319fc1e3abf83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "桂冠前辈感觉……很深不可测呢。\r\n明明看起来那么温柔，但不知道\r\n为什么，总是让我背脊发凉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bef093f41a67380c4aabd8be3c735e59a36e8ef00f77772b4c26db3cee88410e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dbb3c21cd0a95bd1a6bd6c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是白仁前辈担任圣诞老人，\r\n感觉她会直接把礼物丢进烟囱耶。\r\n唔、太帅气了～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53200e6072104f8456abf4992c8d851772a5fd2606fb1c76672f8aeee6518e9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4254379d4882c5595fb0b326",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被气槽前辈提醒我领带歪了，\r\n还帮我整理领带……\r\n太、太丢脸了～～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7d7b5dde8a17b461f650d809c2e713bc56728b49f998d885c30b2c3155b45f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8a8e18e4d5a0e0ea2e17043",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真弓跑来跟我说\r\n我们的决胜服配色很像……\r\n角色重复是什么意思？",
      "source_fingerprint": "43aa3d24a3d677a4fe2b9cd08f356ae9867731466ea8b34d082a7dab96b51937",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bfc86135aaf9ef78eb87a87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在换装时，\r\n赤骥那家伙一直不断偷瞄我……\r\n到底是怎样啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "442610e97ec4f78c572162549fc4ec192eac4df8f63002d07bc377f3f3b5a690",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:978edf2e5c892512dfd38311",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在圣诞节以外的日子能不能也用\r\n圣诞老人的身份有什么表现啊……\r\n像是去外送午餐之类的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "34623d01cadbbe311abe30773814e12a0ae5b611c13f84e3f7ec7b4a9fbcd3ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f426a14e0ef3fb05b44c1a31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在不夜城里奔驰的送货员……\r\n欸，不觉得听起来很酷吗？\r\n会有点向往对吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0aac70a8fee4791401e7a3f016ec4e85e1061d4c25c5571f1942acd4ec77358a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec590b42ae44feec58aaf0dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新生也会参加今年的圣诞活动吧……\r\n好，得让大家都玩得开心才行！\r\n这下我全身是劲啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "38b393336d2c29ff9b4df143e5fad88d6749b8743807cc28fd205c0b21ffe3d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddbed8d76f2ace6cd287b9c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说世上还有会冲浪的圣诞老人，\r\n真的假的啊……这不受常识束缚的\r\n态度，实在太帅啦……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a67c31a0f851eddc8b86ebad93fdb76507f454b8b4a6d5de898589cdc73e98d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f0da415a3e2b270eeb16ca7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我去了趟居家百货，发现店里\r\n已经开始为圣诞节做准备了。\r\n大家都很期待圣诞老人登场呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "684e7fdec48d98cc3cd36f0f3cd664d1c8cb2ba3961ec547fb29b8214dd2c8d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67acbf55561a3a8d5bfa8663",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又来到单板滑雪的季节啦～！\r\n我快练成一个绝招了！\r\n练好后就让你在贵宾席观赏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36a02433ef742347f1480d2301755440432773be9af85a963613ecf0edc07721",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cfa83fbe61aecf747c82aa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你不觉得穿着这身打扮骑摩托车\r\n很帅气吗？就像潇洒地奔驰而过的\r\n圣诞老人摩托车骑士！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00e394c5aeecd2892ba47abbd751a844bab8e5a39d314e51fa312bece4d44540",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7517342bb8c2ed2b2ef0e590",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我家弟妹都很向往见到圣诞老人！\r\n要是我背着礼物突然回家，\r\n他们一定会很开心的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcd323178a211e9fe634fca2eb7f1a9f7658ebf1625c49c81bd877c16be8836f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:164f3bd57fa8843fdde16892",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练，就麻烦你咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08330562b38ea2e39099d0732054cd49da6ee3055531d3a2bc40e23a72dba8e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d402fd53353cd7feeca18431",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くぜっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7040f47fe3c7f5fec78a5889a0840dad2bb2d1bb19ed5bc2f453dfee802ee79a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6ea2848af29051077dd69df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不要给我随便的指示哦。\r\n我可是认真以顶点为目标的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "307304c539fd23278cce6ae54cc1fd7336c1281e5a4a3852e7c7d58727c7d3b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5c985cd56111d9f236a720c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我等好久了！\r\n来吧，我们赶快开始吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89f4bb850d6d8ca23cd97ca3199c7a15d13039a1b8e97bba2381fba6f850caee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e790f123825d5b13a9c6f3ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "饭也吃了、也在课堂上午睡过了。\r\n好──！准备万全了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14d364c36345d6e7fe8e9c947c3ccccb100e91e4977194d96bb00ca3b982fbfa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acd97de91de473fbeff05fad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有什么都尽管来吧！\r\n没有什么事情……是我办不到的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea052f9cb36ed10c2af61dc9d220c03e1e137f6e652ac6580bc0fcaa96f4fecf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0666ff19549139a927bd2f4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也渐渐地……\r\n开始散发出强者的气场了呢！\r\n嘿嘿，你也真是不简单啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0f48b4f806f8e5cb5eb5c3574a9e79f6cac59c43b771e8a91d7ea2e9808d5ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58c770948836405540e349cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还会再变得更强的。\r\n你可要紧紧跟上，不要被甩开了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea867e8d0254d025090404e160e71a76c6871d05bcdf46883a6951368dc0d28c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1669378be7607a0f5188eb9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拜托你严厉的指导了！\r\n……我有个绝对不想输的人啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e0b4e3b2214cafbf4ca27273faf181f03a80319f7258b755e9580e0ee546a05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec24ef19e47db7745b23d920",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好～出发啰！\r\n管它积雪路还是一片漆黑我都不怕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be9e657b33a7e50039e777efb7827a060df21b8a87fdf098bbcf7d38d6d3bb30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d202a1b3adb54dd574282749",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我自己就能身兼圣诞老人跟麋鹿了，\r\n训练员就……负责为我加油吧！\r\n很好，交给你啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d61c58d3dc7a04b9efb66fd0eff70157a433753b5e8de03625bd6c596125ba77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c429886f61d0aad7d96e6390",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "扛着沉重的礼物袋到处跑，\r\n应该会是不错的训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a2ca777417f830206eaea7a0d1b20c3c87983d8953ab7bd227c4414225142fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:508f626418b148137e306ce1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用这身打扮跑步，\r\n小朋友看了都很开心呢。\r\n训练起来也更有干劲了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8439a2bb31ca3756b3d5a684b759b3c54393b9bc351a3875c2760796197e62bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c994feb2b50a78c74c22b09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要尽情闪耀，\r\n让所有人都看得目不转睛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b46c40175c9b571d128ddab9688dfea9359f42a47532866bc21eef769095cad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:862bbd2358d200b3a70a4cdd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，训练完后去吃火鸡吧！\r\n要大口大口、狂野地吃肉！\r\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6c309aa67a8ca2e388b23974128e3f69d2eb1656b5e156f0362f449327ba39a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:818b75ca1c3bd40f7e824905",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好，伙伴！\r\n一起追求能跑遍世界的脚力吧！\r\n大朋友小朋友一定都等不及了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f350f494390d9cce8d9553ca5a412665dab3f84c54b88eb3cda2f5d45c161116",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8161383dc9d5aaf26949bbda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿！真不愧是我的伙伴！",
      "source_fingerprint": "38bdd8f4cb5cacc02d3186d128d6ca0483cd3e7cf66a29eacd07b3f27133b024",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a47af1900608abc0e8c96c2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我刚刚很帅吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c17ffc25db95d828f37252b86bfd9e14778af7bb06c2a7789f4d5533abe3ef2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7aa8d2954d7597aa33b18bda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这真是最棒的礼物了，对吧？伙伴！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ad65777c15f3c5f798008173609b480ecee92891362829a92c13a9d68cdf447",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81d49166bb9a28b32593a165",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的圣诞老人打扮怎么样？嘿嘿！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f36eb54224d183ca6c12230ab63e37494b78dda6adcdc375e6e440ab80f13a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb0caa8000e782101a5fab97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊──！感觉热血起来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad5911c21fa68e5c50b018ec5de9ddd1a937ad9db3b6cb85b4471556c7a923a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50215d97c9e942574db1c74f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会跑出……\r\n超越仪表盘的速、度、的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ce809111f20cb5c2b44d730180f5a4b807a12938ec77940ab6a2b9f85357e28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9306f3bff1fa8d8a0beb377c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔！我是伏特加！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd771e2691868717c0bcb59d14ad6fd30f33dc0d81a310f9997bab7471520b81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b6d6d096736dea02dcb2ab3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abd39c284289b19c8944436e7ca3b6b2ead589d70912da6f1ecd3665819f7367",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43f99e199832724c348e9078",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你可以再更依靠我哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0ac16a89bc48ebeda5b0dc420a480f2d86a125eccaf5214a53d906c220f38c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4473bdc781f79c4f944f6caa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闪开闪开！圣诞老人要冲刺啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fd011fb81c201bc41a4767a3fb798d9c98bf90b7fb33f2e3b918b045ee47111",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "95007"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
